    "name_raw": "Sinuous Vines",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Wilderness Origins pg. 11",
    "definition_raw": "Source Wilderness Origins pg. 11\nYour vines can wrap around foes you grapple.\n\nPrerequisites: Dex 13, Improved Grapple, Improved Unarmed Strike, base attack bonus +6, gathlain.\n\nBenefit: You gain a +2 bonus on combat maneuver checks to grapple, and your wings count as a free hand for the purpose of grappling a foe. You can maintain a grapple with your wings and still make attacks with your other limbs. You cannot fly while maintaining a grapple with your wings.",
